# A kill with loot (run by tools/feel/check.sh with FEEL_LOOT=1, which gives
# the Straw Dummy a sure drop): the fall, the pop, and the loot's sparkle a
# moment after.
say /feel
wait 3
say /time noon
wait 1
walk-to creature straw_dummy 2.2
look-at creature straw_dummy
orbit 35
wait 1.5
clip-start loot
click right creature straw_dummy
wait 2.5
clip-end
